# Notebooks

- Research notebooks live in `toric_spines/notebooks/` (**main** only).
- Use **Jupytext** so notebooks stay reviewable and syncable as paired text (prefer percent `.py` or markdown pair formats when adding new notebooks).
- Notebooks demonstrate and explore the package API; put reusable logic in `pymcfs/`, not only in notebook cells.
- Run notebook-related commands through uv when needed (e.g. `uv run jupytext …`).
- Keep meshes under `toric_spines/data/` and write outputs under `outputs/` (or another explicit output location), not scattered in the repo root.
